  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Water, sanitation, and hygiene response to floods in the La Mojana region</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of this project is to provide WASH assistance to people affected by floods in La Mojana. This UNICEF project provides water, sanitation and hygiene services. The project provides humanitarian assistance to 12,000 people, including 4,296 women, 3,932 men, 3,772 children, and including 700 persons with disabilities.</narrative>
  </description>
